t":"Watermarking schemes for authentication purposes are characterized by three factors: security, resolution of tamper localization, and embedding distortion. Since the requirements of high security, high localization resolution, and low distortion cannot be fulfilled simultaneously, the relative importance of a particular factor is application-dependent. Moreover, blockwise dependence is recognized as a key requirement for fragile watermarking schemes to thwart the Holliman-Memon counterfeiting attack. However, it has also been observed that deterministic dependence is still susceptible to transplantation attack or even simple cover-up attack. This work proposes a fragile watermarking scheme for image authentication, which exploits nondeterministic dependence and provides the users with freedom of making trade-offs among the three factors according to the needs of their applications.","authors":[{"id":"a5075200053","name":"Chang‐Tsun Li","orcid":"0000-0003-4735-6138","institution_ids":["i39555362"]}],"institution_ids":["i39555362"],"venue":{"id":"venue-85bb70469a9752","name":"Optical Engineering","short_name":"","type":"journal","issn":"","rankings":[]},"task_tags":["digital_watermarking"],"contribution_type":"method","review_status":"verified","doi":"10.1117/1.2402932","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"W2064614670","semantic_scholar_id":"","primary_url":"https://doi.org/10.1117/1.2402932","citation_count":25,"provenance":[{"source":"openalex","source_id":"W2064614670","url":"https://openalex.org/W2064614670","query":"digital image watermarking authentication","retrieved_at":"2026-07-15T06:11:49Z"},{"source":"crossref","source_id":"10.1117/1.2402932","url":"https://doi.org/10.1117/1.2402932","query":"digital image watermarking authentication","retrieved_at":"2026-07-15T06:17:04Z"},{"source":"semantic_scholar","source_id":"26105b8907500e0b639a86dd0c71eea149eb1543","url":"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/26105b8907500e0b639a86dd0c71eea149eb1543","query":"fragile watermark image tamper localization","retrieved_at":"2026-07-15T18:33:23Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：已有稳定来源，且现有任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"},{"id":"paper-ae8f304a6f2af9d0","title":"An Image Watermarking Algorithm Robust to Geometric Distortion","title_zh":"","year":2003,"publication_date":"","abstract":"","authors":[{"id":"author-db82723e971068","name":"Xiangui Kang","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]},{"id":"author-7b0ab3c086b7ce","name":"Jiwu Huang","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]},{"id":"author-4a63ff4594f8c7","name":"Yun Q. Shi","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]}],"institution_ids":[],"venue":{"id":"venue-331da547ef2215","name":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","short_name":"","type":"unknown","issn":"0302-9743","rankings":[]},"task_tags":["digital_watermarking"],"contribution_type":"method","review_status":"verified","doi":"10.1007/3-540-36617-2_18","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"","semantic_scholar_id":"","primary_url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/3-540-36617-2_18","citation_count":9,"provenance":[{"source":"crossref","source_id":"10.1007/3-540-36617-2_18","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/3-540-36617-2_18","query":"robust invisible image watermarking","retrieved_at":"2026-07-16T04:06:14Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：具有稳定来源，且任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"},{"id":"paper-9f992e0e6dd336d0","title":"&lt;title&gt;Content-fragile watermarking for image authentication&lt;/title&gt;","title_zh":"","year":2001,"publication_date":"","abstract":"","authors":[{"id":"author-0f4eb63106a4c6","name":"Jana Dittmann","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]}],"institution_ids":[],"venue":{"id":"venue-8d994985ad436f","name":"SPIE Proceedings","short_name":"","type":"conference","issn":"0277-786X","rankings":[]},"task_tags":["digital_watermarking"],"contribution_type":"method","review_status":"verified","doi":"10.1117/12.435398","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"","semantic_scholar_id":"","primary_url":"https://doi.org/10.1117/12.435398","citation_count":15,"provenance":[{"source":"crossref","source_id":"10.1117/12.435398","url":"https://doi.org/10.1117